  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>林克字型</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">說明</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">多虧這款以《薩爾達傳說：風之杖》為基礎的字型，您的原版遊戲體驗將進一步提升。本字型專為&nbsp;<a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">DarkRPG</a> 整合包設計，現已公開提供下載！&nbsp;<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">基於 <a style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffontmeme.com%252ffonts%252fsherwood-font%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sherwood</a> 字型。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\">該字型採用自由字型授權（Free Font License）。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/585/626/sherwood_specimen.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"970\" height=\"484\"><span style=\"font-family:andale mono, monospace;font-size:18px\"><br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:andale mono, monospace\"><strong>螢幕截圖（來自 DarkRPG）</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/584/162/2022-12-27_04.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"600\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即購買伺服器，與朋友一起遊玩！點擊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 或下方橫幅 &amp; 使用代碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 可享 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>